        <span class="section-index">01 / Excavator-Mounted Cutters</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Trench Cutters for Excavators —<br><em class="serif-italic">up to 1,400 mm cutting depth</em></h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">The LIBA excavator-mounted trench cutters GM 140 H, GM 140 AFH-500 and GM 140 AFH-600 are hydraulically driven chain cutters for wheeled and tracked excavators from 6 t. Cutting depths from 200 to 1,400 mm, cutting widths from 60 to 400 mm — for cable, pipeline and utility installation.</p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>GM 140 H</strong><span>Trench cutter for excavators from 6 t. Cutting depth up to 900 mm, cutting width 60–350 mm. Compact for earth cables and municipal civil engineering.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>GM 140 AFH-500</strong><span>Mid-range model for pipeline and cable installation. Cutting depth up to 500 mm, carrier machine from 8 t.</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="num">03</span><div><strong>GM 140 AFH-600</strong><span>Increased cutting depth up to 600 mm for pipeline installation DN 100–DN 200, carrier machine from 12 t.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
